The '''Whirl Cup winner''' is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[EP217|The Perfect Match!]]''

He battled [[Trinity]] in the final stages of the [[Whirl Cup]]. However, just before the battle began, {{TRT}} broke into the competition with the intent of stealing the [[Sea Spirit]]. He, Trinity, {{Ash}}, and {{an|Misty}} defeated Team Rocket, and he continued with the battle.

Although the battle was not shown, he appeared later receiving a [[Mystic Water]] for winning the competition.
